# Root (cargo-xcode-generated) project: opening it auto-generates scheme and
# workspace state that isn't meant to be shared. Only iphone/touchHLE.xcodeproj
# has an intentionally-tracked shared scheme.
/touchHLE.xcodeproj/xcshareddata/

